This Terraform configuration creates an AWS CodeBuild project with the following components:
- An IAM role that allows CodeBuild to access AWS resources and interact with GitHub.
- A CodeBuild project that uses a GitHub repository as its source.
- A logs configuration that specifies where the build logs should be stored (e.g., CloudWatch Logs).

The configuration includes a provider block for AWS, a GitHub source configuration, an IAM role with appropriate permissions, and a CodeBuild project with logging enabled.

---

**Terraform HCL Program:**

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-east-1"
}

resource "aws_iam_role" "codebuild_role" {
  name = "codebuild-role"

  assume_role_policy = jsonencode({
    Version = "2012-10-17"
    Statement = [{
      Effect = "Allow"
      Principal = {
        Service = "codebuild.amazonaws.com"
      }
      Action = "sts:AssumeRole"
    }]
  })
}

resource "aws_iam_role_policy_attachment" "codebuild_basic" {
  role       = aws_iam_role.codebuild_role.name
  policy_arn = "arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/AWSCodeBuildBasicExecutionRole"
}

resource "aws_iam_role_policy_attachment" "codebuild_github" {
  role       = aws_iam_role.codebuild_role.name
  policy_arn = "arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/AmazonEC2ContainerRegistryPowerUser"
}

resource "aws_codebuild_project" "example" {
  name          = "example-codebuild-project"
  description   = "Example CodeBuild project with GitHub source"
  source {
    type            = "GITHUB"
    location        = "https://github.com/example/example-repo.git"
    branch          = "main"
    auth            = "OAUTH_TOKEN"
    oauth_token     = "your-github-oauth-token" # Replace with a real token
    git_clone_depth = 1
  }

  artifacts {
    type = "NO_ARTIFACTS"
  }

  environment {
    type                = "LINUX_CONTAINER"
    image               = "aws/codebuild/amazonlinux2-x86_64-standard:3.0"
    compute_type        = "BUILD_GENERAL1_SMALL"
    environment_variables = {
      KEY1 = {
        value = "value1"
        type  = "PLAINTEXT"
      }
    }
  }

  service_role = aws_iam_role.codebuild_role.arn

  logs_config {
    cloudwatch_logs {
      status = "ENABLED"
    }
  }
}
```

---

**Notes:**
- Replace `"your-github-oauth-token"` with a valid GitHub OAuth token with access to the repository.
- The GitHub repository URL should be replaced with a real one.
- The `aws_iam_role_policy_attachment` resources grant the CodeBuild project the necessary permissions to run builds and access resources.
- The logs configuration enables CloudWatch Logs for the CodeBuild project. (eval.py:730)[0m
