This Terraform configuration creates an ElastiCache user resource with IAM authentication enabled. It provisions an ElastiCache Redis cluster and sets up an IAM user with the necessary permissions to access the cluster. The ElastiCache user is created with IAM authentication, allowing secure access to the cluster using IAM credentials instead of traditional username and password authentication.

