This Terraform configuration will create a 2-node Amazon Redshift cluster using the `dc2.large` node type. It will also configure the concurrency scaling settings to allow scaling for a maximum of 60 minutes. The configuration includes a dedicated IAM role for Redshift with the necessary permissions to access AWS services. The cluster will be deployed in the `us-west-2` region, and all required variables are provided with default values for ease of deployment.

