This Terraform configuration will create a serverless Apache Kafka (MSK) cluster in the `us-east-1` region with 3 broker nodes. The cluster will be provisioned using AWS Managed Streaming for Apache Kafka (MSK) and will be configured with a single Kafka topic. The configuration includes a necessary IAM role for MSK and ensures that the cluster is deployed in a secure and scalable manner.

