This Terraform configuration creates an AWS S3 bucket to store code build outputs and an AWS CodeBuild project that uses this S3 bucket to store its artifacts. The CodeBuild project is configured with a specific environment type and image, and it is set up to pull source code from a GitHub repository. The configuration includes all necessary resources and variables with default values, ensuring it is fully deployable with Terraform and the AWS provider.

