This Terraform configuration will create a VPC with public subnets, a security group for database access, and a PostgreSQL database instance (version 17.1, 5GB capacity) within the VPC. The PostgreSQL instance will be secured by a dedicated security group that allows access from the public subnets and restricts access to only necessary traffic. The configuration includes a provider block for AWS, a VPC with public subnets, a security group for the database, and an RDS PostgreSQL instance.

